"685\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"685\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"685\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"720\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"510\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"710\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"290\" stroke=\"var(--hb-pri)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#hbArr)\"/>\n</svg><table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Nhóm MCAL</th><th>Các Module Cốt Lõi</th><th>Module ID</th><th>Nhiệm vụ cốt lõi & Phối hợp tầng trên</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Microcontroller Drivers</td><td><b>Mcu</b></td><td><span class='mono'>101</span></td><td>Clock Tree, PLL Lock/Distribute, ResetReason, PowerMode (RUN/HALT/STOP), Init RAM Section. Điều phối bởi <code>EcuM</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>I/O Drivers</td><td><b>Port · Dio · Adc · Pwm</b></td><td><span class='mono'>124, 120, 123, 121</span></td><td>Pin Mux PCR, đọc/ghi Digital tức thời, chuyển đổi cảm biến Analog SAR 12-bit, điều chế xung PWM 0..0x8000 qua <code>IoHwAb</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Communication Drivers</td><td><b>Spi · Can</b></td><td><span class='mono'>83, 80</span></td><td>Truyền chuỗi <code>Seq→Job→Ch</code> (QSPI) và điều phối khung CAN / CAN-FD qua hộp thư <code>HTH / HRH</code> qua <code>CanIf / CanTrcv</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Drivers</td><td><b>Fls</b></td><td><span class='mono'>92</span></td><td>Xóa Sector (0xFF), Ghi/Đọc/So sánh Page Data Flash bất đồng bộ không chặn CPU qua <code>Fls_MainFunction()</code> phục vụ <code>Fee → NvM</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
